75.m:
their residence is the pure, faultless realm of Brahmā,
the supreme destination above all destinations;
it is proclaimed to be fourteen thousand yojanas.

76.m:
there is the exalted city of all the immortals on the Cakravāṭa,
unassailable by gods, Dānavas, and Rākṣasas arrogant with strength;
there is an excellent rampart of gold with beautiful archways.

94.m:
All those goddesses in their crores stood surrounding that Goddess;
they fought with the enemies, their quivers strapped on, possessing great might.
In an instant, that entire army of the Dānavas was destroyed by them.
